  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Spotlight Initiative invests in programmes that improve the rights and opportunities of women and girls around the world through the prevention of and response to all forms of violence against women and girls. Spotlight Initiative supports comprehensive, whole-of-society and inclusive approaches that enable women and girls to live lives free from the debilitating experience or effects of harmful practices and various forms of violence.</narrative>
